  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_dog_skin_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the skin of a dog, or the leather made from it; also applied to a kind of leather made from sheep-skin (OED s.v. dog-skin) (see also pellis)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
